=== Family parameterization of E_PCP(q) ===
(m, n) with gcd=1, m+n odd, m > n > 0:
  q = (m^2 - n^2)/(2mn)
  E_PCP: Y^2 = X(X+1)(X + q^2)

Integer model after X -> X'/(2mn)^2, Y -> Y'/(2mn)^3:
  Y^2 = X (X + u^2)(X + v^2),  u = 2mn, v = m^2 - n^2
       = X^3 + (u^2+v^2) X^2 + u^2 v^2 X

